(4358, 'Short cuts', 52, NULL, '0', 2, 0, 'sho', 'So just what is with this fascination for the Japanese teenage girl? We\'re talking about that extreme variant of her--that highly evolved creature of Japan\'s frantically trendy consumer culture...the ko-gal. Short Cuts is a unique and surreal Japanese comic strip that provides an illustrated journey into the ko-gal\'s world, created by Usamaru Furuya, one of Japan\'s most highly esteemed avant-garde comic artists.'),
