(9779, 'Kings in disguise (V.O.)', 39, NULL, '2', 0, 0, 'Kin', 'It is January 1932, and movie-loving Freddie Bloch is trading his father\'s liquor bottles for the cost of a cheap matinee: \"Dreams were only a dime, empty bottles brought a penny apiece. When his father suddenly disappears and his brother gets arrested, Freddie finds himself homeless and adrift, trying to survive the Detroit labor riots and the furor of violent, anti-Communist mobs.'),
